                                "sense_id": "0796cc27-ec54-33e8-bd9b-7aec90a939e0",
                                "text": "Such a dynamic, biological concept of consciousness as reflecting ever-shifting 'global mappings' in the brain, ceaseless relatings of current perceptions to past mappings, has been articulated with great force recently, by Gerald Edelman."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
